    <string name="faq_a1">In 1.1 the limit counted only listed apps (TikTok, Likee, Roblox) and Access control was off by default. In 1.2 the whole phone counts by default. Check the Protection card on the home screen — it shows how Хранитоникс treats the last opened app.</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Home → Manage (or long-press a card) → PIN → the 🗑 button next to the app. Any app can be removed, including TikTok, Likee and Roblox; bring them back with Restore.</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">In Хранитоникс Бокс choose the child and minutes, then send the 9-digit code by messenger or SMS. The child taps 🎁 Time by code and pastes it. No internet needed.</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">The firmware kills background apps. Enable auto-start: Settings → Protection → Open auto-start settings. Also lock Хранитоникс in Recents (padlock) and disable battery optimisation for it.</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">Besides time, Box can create codes that lift night mode (for an hour or until morning), end a break, allow the phone while charging, lift school time or open settings for 10 minutes. They\'re entered the same way — 🎁 Time by code.</string>
    <string name="faq_a6">Settings (PIN) → Protection → Disable uninstall protection, then uninstall the app as usual.</string>
    <string name="faq_q1">Why didn\'t time go down while the child used Instagram?</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">How do I remove an app from the list?</string>
