    <string name="guide_intro">6 steps to set up Хранитоникс properly. Takes about 5 minutes.</string>
    <string name="guide_s1">1. PIN, name and character</string>
    <string name="guide_s1_t">Choose a 4-digit PIN that only the parent knows. It opens settings, bonuses and unlocks. Enter the child\'s name — the app will call them by name. Pick a character: Sema, Timma, Olezhka or Hronitoniks.</string>
    <string name="guide_s2">2. Permissions and auto-start</string>
    <string name="guide_s2_t">Grant 4 permissions: usage access, display over other apps, no battery optimisation, notifications. On Huawei/Honor also: Settings → Battery → App launch → Хранитоникс → Manage manually, turn on all 3 switches. The Protection card on the home screen should be green.</string>
    <string name="guide_s3">3. Daily limit and breaks</string>
    <string name="guide_s3_t">Settings → Limit and breaks: e.g. 2 hours a day and a 5-minute break every 30 minutes. By default the whole phone counts — any app uses time except allowed ones. Strict mode covers the app with a block screen; soft mode only reminds.</string>
    <string name="guide_s4">4. Allowed and blocked apps</string>
    <string name="guide_s4_t">Apps and rules: mark allowed apps (textbooks, maps, music) — they don\'t use time. Put on the blacklist what is never allowed. Tracked apps can get their own limit (e.g. TikTok — 30 minutes) or be removed with 🗑.</string>
    <string name="guide_s5">5. What the child sees</string>
    <string name="guide_s5_t">When time runs out, or a break, night or school starts, the app is minimised and a screen with the character appears. Home and Back don\'t remove it. A parent can enter the PIN to add time, and the child can enter a Box code with the 🎁 Time by code button.</string>
    <string name="guide_s6">6. Link with Хранитоникс Бокс</string>
    <string name="guide_s6_t">Install Хранитоникс Бокс on the parent\'s phone. Here: Settings → Link with Хранитоникс Бокс → Create new key and send the key to Box (or the other way round). The parent can now grant time and lift night mode with codes — even offline.</string>
